            Older adults need more per dose. Muscles become less responsive to protein with age, so researchers commonly suggest about 0.4 g/kg per meal, and at least 30 g, for people over about 60. Our <a href="/how-much-protein-do-i-need/">protein needs guide</a> covers daily targets in detail.
